project: Task renderer-fx done (open issues: The page's `script` URL parameter is applied with runScript before the first frame and then synced with an empty event list, so a scripted URL cannot show hits, shakes or bursts; a screenshot of such a URL can only confirm that the page still renders without console errors. To see the feedback on screen the page needs a real keypress (which is also what unlocks audio). My pixel measurements and the Chrome scratch pages cover the visuals instead.; Pre-existing and left untouched: syncItems draws items regardless of tile visibility, so a few gold/item shapes float in the dark on unexplored tiles (visible in the screenshots). It is unrelated to this task's feedback layer.; The killed creature's mesh lingers up to ~0.25 s; if the game restarts (R) within that window and a new monster reuses the same id, that monster is briefly invisible until the corpse is removed. Ids otherwise never collide, so this only matters for a restart inside a quarter second of a kill.).
